      <topic_keywords>
        <keyword>무기성분</keyword>
        <keyword>결핍</keyword>
        <keyword>증상</keyword>
        <keyword>노엽에서</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>3</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>마그네슘</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 재배학 · 마그네슘 결핍
정답은 ③이다. 마그네슘은 엽록소 구성원소로 체내 이동성이 커서 결핍 시 노엽부터 엽맥 사이가 황백화된다. 석회(Ca)가 과다하면 길항작용으로 흡수가 억제된다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>철</choice_text>
          <commentary>철 결핍은 어린잎부터 나타난다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>황</choice_text>
          <commentary>황 결핍은 어린잎부터 나타난다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>마그네슘</choice_text>
          <commentary>마그네슘이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>붕소</choice_text>
          <commentary>붕소 결핍은 생장점에 나타난다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
