        <keyword>배수체의 염색체 조성</keyword>
      </topic_keywords>
      <answer_info>
        <correct_answer>4</correct_answer>
        <correct_choice_text>동질배수체 생물: $3x$</correct_choice_text>
        <answer_source>정답표</answer_source>
      </answer_info>
      <overall_commentary>출제 영역: 재배학 · 배수체의 염색체 조성
정답은 ④이다. 동질배수체는 같은 게놈이 배가된 것으로 3배체는 3x로 표시한다. 반수체는 n, 1염색체 생물은 2n - 1, 3염색체 생물은 2n + 1이다.</overall_commentary>
      <choice_explanations>
        <choice_explanation no="1" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>반수체 생물: $\frac{1}{2} n$</choice_text>
          <commentary>반수체는 n이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>1 염색체 생물: $2 n + 1$</choice_text>
          <commentary>1염색체는 2n - 1이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>3 염색체 생물: $4 n - 1$</choice_text>
          <commentary>3염색체는 2n + 1이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="true" judgment="[O] (정답)">
          <choice_text>동질배수체 생물: $3x$</choice_text>
          <commentary>동질배수체 3x이므로 옳다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
      </choice_explanations>
