        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="true" judgment="[X] (정답)">
          <choice_text>쿠마린(Coumarin)</choice_text>
          <commentary>쿠마린은 발아억제 물질이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
