          <choice_text>Dichlorprop － 사과 후기 낙과방지</choice_text>
          <commentary>사과 후기 낙과방지이므로 정답이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="2" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Cycocel － 수박 착과증진</choice_text>
          <commentary>Cycocel은 왜화제이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="3" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Phosfon-D － 국화 발근촉진</choice_text>
          <commentary>Phosfon-D는 왜화제이다.</commentary>
        </choice_explanation>
        <choice_explanation no="4" is_answer="false" judgment="[X]">
          <choice_text>Amo-1618 － 콩나물 생장촉진</choice_text>
